# The ROOT .gitignore at the repo root cannot be edited from this tool
# chain (writes to it are refused) -- see ratesheet/.gitignore for the
# same note. Each self-contained sub-app therefore carries its own
# .gitignore for its own runtime data, which git honors identically to
# a root-level entry.
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite-wal
data/*.sqlite-shm
data/tracks/
